	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"Figure-rise Standard 超サイヤ人ベジットがパッケージをリニューアルして登場！！",
			"• 最大約450mmのビッグスケール！",
			"約65mmの貫かれているブウとベジットソードが付属。",
			"• 特徴的な配色の胴着と手袋や靴などは成形色で再現。",
			"• 各関節の可動と肩の引き出し、腰の前屈により、劇中のバトルシーンを再現可能。",
			"• ベジットソードは4つのパーツで長さを調整可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Figure-rise Standard Super Saiyan Vegito is now available with a renewed package! !",
			"• Big Scale up to about 450mm!",
			"Buu and Vegetto Sword, which have been pierced approximately 65mm, are included.",
			"• The distinctive color scheme of the body, gloves, and shoes are reproduced in molded colors.",
			"• The battle scenes from the movie can be recreated by moving each joint, pulling out the shoulders, and bending the hips forward.",
			"• The length of Vegetto Sword can be adjusted with 4 parts."
		]
	},
